      "first": {
        "speaker": 40,
        "line": 2,
        "text": "COLONEL DAX. ceccccccecceses commander of the 18ist Regiment. A handsome man in his thirties - vigorous and tanned by the weather, GENERAL ROUSSEAU, eececccese commander of the Fourth Division, of which the 181lst Regiment is a part."
      },
      "last": {
        "speaker": 1,
        "line": 439,
        "text": "Colonel, may I ask you to join me at the Chateau for some coffee? COL, DAX I'd be very happy to, sir. I might even suggest something a little stronger, if it isn't too early for you,"
      }
